@page "/not-found"
@inject ShiftBlazorLocalizer Loc

@* This page has no LayoutView. The router renders it with the Found template, both as the
   NotFoundPage and at /not-found, and the RouteView there already puts it inside the app's main
   layout. A LayoutView would add that layout a second time, and the second MudPopoverProvider
   would throw. *@
<PageTitle>@Loc["DefaultAppNotFoundTitle"]</PageTitle>
<h1>404</h1>
<p role="alert">@Loc["DefaultAppNotFoundText"]</p>